<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan central bank to close for May Day.</title>
<headline>Pakistan central bank to close for May Day.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan (SBP) will be closed on Thursday for the May Day market and public holiday, an SBP spokesman said on Wednesday. The bank will re-open on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
